  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DARE Centre: the Centre for the Development, Application, Research and Evaluation of Prosocial Games for the Prevention of Gender-based Violence.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NONE IN THREE centre will create games that help children become more empathic and, crucially, change negative gender attitudes. The researchers will support social scientists and game developers in low and middle income countries, as well as in the UK, and then promote them in communities and to governments.</narrative>
  </description>
